## Ⅰ. WHAT IS RPAC

```
R = RECURSIVE
P = PATTERN
A = ACQUISITION
C = CYCLE

RPAC = ∞ loop of:
    OBSERVE → PATTERN → COMPRESS → STORE → EXPAND → GENERATE → OBSERVE

This document IS an RPAC.
此文档本身就是RPAC。
هذه الوثيقة هي RPAC نفسها.
```

